OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fcontinue overnight, mostly in the west
OL,7,Fand north. Elsewhere it stays mostly
OL,8,Fdry with clear spells. Winds easing
OL,9,Finto the early hours and feeling cool
OL,10,Ffor many.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAny showers will ease
OL,13,Fthrough the morning, leaving a mostly
OL,14,Fdry and bright day with sunny spells.
OL,15,FLight winds making it feel slightly
OL,16,Fwarmer than Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
